From f2e35344029a9c60e2fe191cea59a0efa621c6df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mono <81423605+monofunc@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Apr 2026 12:39:38 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(d3d11): add Metal interop interface for external texture
 and fence sharing

Introduce IMTLD3D11InteropDevice, a COM interface that allows external consumers to share Metal resources with the D3D11 device:

* ImportMTLTexture2D: adopt an existing MTLTexture as a D3D11 Texture2D, with full property and usage validation
* GetFenceSharedEvent: extract the MTLSharedEvent handle from a fence

Supporting changes:

* dxmt: add Texture::adopt() for wrapping externally owned Metal textures
* winemetal: add MTLTexture_getInfo thunk to query properties of an externally owned MTLTexture
